{"id":"u-82b933b8-9b76-4350-aba7-08bd86ccaa97","src":"community","title":"Heavy Duty Weighted Calisthenics Program","author":"Arbaaz khan","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/lWgsHx-heavy-duty-weighted-calisthenics-program","desc":"Inspired by Mike Mentzer’s Heavy Duty philosophy, this program is built around one principle: make every working set count. High intensity, low volume, progressive overload, and deliberate recovery form the foundation.\n\nHeavy compound movements are paired with weighted calisthenics to build practical strength alongside muscular development. Each session is designed to deliver a powerful stimulus without unnecessary volume, allowing the body time to recover, adapt, and grow.\n\nThe program embraces Mentzer’s belief that training is the stimulus, while recovery is where the transformation happens. Every rep has a purpose. Every working set has a job. Progress is measured not by how much you do, but by how much you can improve.\n\nTrain hard. Recover harder. Grow stronger.","level":["Beginner","Novice"],"goals":["Athletics","Muscle","Strength"],"equipment":["Full Gym"],"minutes":60,"joins":1,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-09-06T20:32:45.590Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Chest, Triceps","Legs","Rest, Light cardio","Back, Biceps","Cardio & Abs","Shoulders, Calisthenics","Rest, Light cardio"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Incline Bench Press (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":8,"pct":50,"x":2},{"lo":4,"hi":5,"pct":70},{"lo":6,"hi":10}]},{"n":"Incline Chest Fly (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":15},{"lo":8,"hi":12,"x":2}]},{"n":"Skull Crusher (EZ Bar)","sets":[{"r":12},{"r":10},{"lo":6,"hi":10}]},{"n":"Tricep Extension (Cable)","sets":[{"r":8},{"lo":8,"hi":12}]},{"n":"Dip (Bodyweight)","sets":[{"amrap":1}]},{"n":"Push Up","sets":[{"amrap":1}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Back Extension (Weighted)","sets":[{"sec":60,"x":3}]},{"n":"Squat (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":8},{"r":5},{"lo":6,"hi":10}]},{"n":"Romanian Deadlift (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":8},{"lo":4,"hi":5},{"l